// 1-25: yellow, yellow, blue, yellow.
id l1-25
name 1-25 HOPSCOTCH
tagline yellow, yellow, blue, yellow.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main anchor pull
mechanics current:16 plank:10 pull:6 anchor:10 yank:1 hack:2 capacitor:2 secret:2
new -
portion 4.2 hop 2 blocks 2 tall and 3 wide over 3-wide current
portion 5.9 hop 6 one-way planks over current (heights 111111)
portion 5.2 zip 2 anchors (mid, high), 9 apart, over current
portion 7 capacitor gate 26 tiles away
portion 5.2 zip 2 anchors (ceiling, high), 9 apart, over current
portion 7.3 capacitor gate 24 tiles away, current notch on the way
portion 6.3 zip 4 anchors (ceiling, high, mid, mid), 9-7-7 apart, over current
portion 5.1 hack port opens a gate, 5-wide current beyond
portion 6 two pull ports up to the top lane
portion 5.6 hack port opens a gate, 6-wide current beyond
portion 6 drive a rail 8 long, swing a 22 gap (ceiling, mid anchors)
portion 4.9 hop 4 one-way planks over current (heights 1112)
portion 4 a secret wall 10 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 6.2 hop 5 floating blocks over current (heights 23233)
portion 6.8 hop 4 pull ports (low, low, mid, low), 8-8-8 apart, over current
portion 6.9 hop 6 floating blocks over current (heights 133213)
portion 5 a low ceiling 12 long over a current notch
hardness 5.7
map
